WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:19.000
I brought the pieces
I could not mend

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.360
The things I promised
I'd never do again

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:32.480
I brought the questions
I tried to hide

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:39.320
Every reason
I thought You'd turn aside

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:46.880
But You never asked
For a better version of me

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.980
You only said
Come

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:56.560
I bring You what I am
You give me who You are

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:02.980
I bring the wounded places
You meet me where they are

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:09.200
I bring You empty hands
You fill this weary heart

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:16.560
I don't have to hide
I don't have to run

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:23.840
You say
Come as you are

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:39.500
I thought that mercy
Was something earned

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:45.900
That I should fix myself
Before I could return

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:52.320
But grace was waiting
Before I knew

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:59.940
I came with nothing
And found everything in You

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:07.060
You never asked
For perfection at the door

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.560
You only said
Come

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:16.280
I bring You what I am
You give me who You are

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:22.540
I bring the wounded places
You meet me where they are

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:28.580
I bring You empty hands
You fill this weary heart

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:36.180
I don't have to hide
I don't have to run

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:43.540
You say
Come as you are

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:55.280
When I am tired

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:58.540
Come
When I am burdened

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:01.840
Come
When I have failed again

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.970
Come
When I am ashamed

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:08.800
Come
Not when I'm stronger

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:16.260
Not when I'm whole
Not when I've earned it

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:24.980
Come
Come to the mercy

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:32.140
Come to the grace
Come to the Savior

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:41.800
He knows your name

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:48.500
I bring You what I am
You give me who You are

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:54.840
I bring the wounded places
You meet me where they are

00:03:54.840 --> 00:04:00.880
I bring You empty hands
You fill this weary heart

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:08.680
I don't have to hide
I don't have to run

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:14.880
You say
Come as you are

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:21.620
I bring You all my weakness
You give me all Your grace

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:29.020
I bring You every failure
You never turn Your face

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:35.180
Nothing left to prove
Nothing left to earn

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:44.660
Only open arms
And one invitation

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:51.760
Come as you are

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:59.520
I bring You what I am

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:05.520
You give me who You are
